# ארכיטקטורה

## Framework

- TanStack Start + TanStack Router — **לא** Next.js/Remix
- Routes: `src/routes/*.tsx` (file-based)
- `routeTree.gen.ts` — auto-generated, לא לערוך
- Root: `src/routes/__root.tsx`

## Server

- Server Functions: `createServerFn` ב-`src/lib/api/`
- Entry: `src/server.ts`, `src/start.ts`
- Config server-only: `*.server.ts`

## Development Flow

```
UI → Types → Zod → ServerFn → React Query → Integration → Testing → Security → Docs
```

## Alias

`@/*` → `./src/*`

## Build

Vite 7 → Nitro → Cloudflare Workers (Lovable config)

## אין לשנות

ארכיטקטורת TanStack Start ללא אישור Lead Architect.
